graph LR
    A["Product Backlog<br/>Talablar ro'yxati<br/>(45 user story)"] --> B["Sprint Planning<br/>2 haftalik sprint<br/>10-12 story tanlash"]
    B --> C["Sprint Backlog<br/>Sprint vazifalari"]
    C --> D["Daily Standup<br/>Har kuni 15 daq<br/>Progress + bloker"]
    D --> E["Development<br/>Kod + test + commit<br/>(har 1-2 kun)"]
    E --> D
    E --> F["Sprint Review<br/>Demo + feedback<br/>(2 hafta oxiri)"]
    F --> G["Sprint Retrospective<br/>Nima yaxshi/yomon<br/>Keyingi sprint uchun saboq"]
